### Translate General Application Form

A general application has been made by {{partyLabel}} which requires translation.

Review the application form in
<a href="/cases/case-details/PCS/PCS/{{caseReference}}#Case%20File%20View">Case File View</a> and arrange
translation.

<a href="{{uploadTranslatedGenAppFormEventUrl}}">Upload the translated application form</a> to the case and then
email it to the court. Only mark the task as complete once the translation has been completed.

Documents:
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  {% for filename in filenames %}
  <li class="govuk-!-font-size-19">{{filename}}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
